-- title:
--   Compatibility potential ceilings for regions 84 to 87 of level-three band 0
-- statement:
--   A rational upper bound on the compatibility potential for 43 compatibility parts of
--   level-three band 0, covering regions 84 to 87.
--
--   The splits of a region are grouped -- boundary cells individually, the rest by their grade in the
